</span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b]" style="left:73.91304347826086%"> Feb 26 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] max-sm:hidden" style="left:86.95652173913044%"> May 26 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b]" style="left:100%"> Aug 26 </span> </div> </div> </div> <p class="mt-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">The 12-month RevPAR of $85 averages each listing's whole year, slow months included; each month here counts only the listings booked in it.</p>  </figure></div> </div> </div> </section>  <section id="seasonality" class="mg-section mg-col"> <div class="mg-title mb-8"> <p class="font-lato text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"> Seasonality </p> <h2 class="mg-serif mt-1.5 text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.12] sm:text-[36px] tracking-[-0.012em] text-[#1e293b]"> Best and Worst Months for Airbnb in Conway </h2>  </div> <div class="mg-report prose max-w-none">  <div id="seasonality-insights"> <p id="seasonality-insights-summary">Conway has one high season, May through August, which makes it a highly seasonal market. Business is slowest from November to April and slows again in September. A listing earns about 2.2 times as much a month in June through August as in December through February.</p><div class="not-prose my-8"><figure class="pseo-figure font-lato rounded-[4px] bg-white shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.06),0_3px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.07)] p-5 sm:p-6 [&#38;_.pseo-table]:shadow-none"> <figcaption> <p class="text-[16px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]">Average revenue by month in Conway</p> <p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-snug text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">Average revenue per active listing, each calendar month averaged over the past two years</p>  </figcaption> <div class="mt-5"><div class="p